{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.madoka.blanket",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "练习室的人走光了",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.madoka.blanket",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.madoka.blanket",
    "idolId": "madoka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "谢谢您。以后也请多指教。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──円香，辛苦了！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "辛苦了。今天在这里解散可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然……啊，对了。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "明天安排了课程，没问题吧？快考试了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……从谁那里听说的？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，浅仓写在日志里了。円香和她同校，我想应该一样吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……没有问题，我会去。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样啊，谢谢！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那明天见。回去路上小心。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "好，辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……──……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……诶。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "打扰了……呃……课程还在进行吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "已经结束了。有什么事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，没什么。只是来看看课的情况。不过好像来晚了一步……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不是晚一步。很久之前就结束了。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "那么，我要回去了，能请你让开吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，辛苦了──声乐老师夸了円香哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "说发声的方法非常好。喉咙打开的方式、切换的方式都是……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……你在努力啊。下次我会好好来看的。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不用了，没什么。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "我先走了。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈啊，今天的会议拖得太长了。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "肚子饿了吧，找个地方吃点──",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "浪费经费。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不不，这里就当是辛苦了，我请──",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不用了。好不容易能和你分开，为什么还要特意？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "您的心意我领了……辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……那么。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……辛苦了。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "──再见。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……辛苦了！",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "辛苦……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "円香……",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "────……呐。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "真的，你真是个不行的人……",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "円香──？",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "──你要睡到什么时候。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………诶。",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……咦……毯子……",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我睡着了……什么时候……",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……手机，有通知。）",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "……现在几点？",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "喝点水吧",
            "nextNodeId": "130"
          },
          {
            "label": "今天就回去吧",
            "nextNodeId": "160"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "通知…………円香发来的……",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "『明天集合地点的地图，还没有收到。』『还没好吗？』『请联系我。』",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！糟了，说好今天之内发的。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对、对不起……！她还醒着吗……",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "『你要睡到什么时候。』"
      },
      "130": {
        "id": "130",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嘿咻……唔，身体好痛……",
        "nextNodeId": "131"
      },
      "131": {
        "id": "131",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（做了个奇怪的梦。说是梦是现实的投影……）",
        "nextNodeId": "132"
      },
      "132": {
        "id": "132",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（从哪里开始是梦……）",
        "nextNodeId": "133"
      },
      "133": {
        "id": "133",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不──……",
        "nextNodeId": "134"
      },
      "134": {
        "id": "134",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哇……搞砸了……啊——啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "135"
      },
      "135": {
        "id": "135",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "136"
      },
      "136": {
        "id": "136",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "137"
      },
      "137": {
        "id": "137",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我真是个不行的人。"
      },
      "160": {
        "id": "160",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "总觉得忘了什么……",
        "nextNodeId": "161"
      },
      "161": {
        "id": "161",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──……啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "162"
      },
      "162": {
        "id": "162",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "要给円香发明天的地图。糟了，她已经睡了吗……！",
        "nextNodeId": "163"
      },
      "163": {
        "id": "163",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "『明天的集合地点』──『非常抱歉』……",
        "nextNodeId": "164"
      },
      "164": {
        "id": "164",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哦，已读了。",
        "nextNodeId": "165"
      },
      "165": {
        "id": "165",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "『知道了。』",
        "nextNodeId": "166"
      },
      "166": {
        "id": "166",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "『真的，你真是个不行的人。』"
      }
    }
  },
